 "remarks": "Bright and Spacious 1-Bedroom Condo. Welcome to this sunny and inviting one bedroom, one-bath condo located on the second floor of a charming two-story building.  The thoughtfully designed layout features updated kitchen, a separate dining room.  HOA cover heat, water and hot water.  This unit also includes up to two parking spaces, plenty of guest parking and a small storage locker area for added practicality.   Perfectly situated for commuters and surrounded by greenery, the location offers the best of both convenience and serenity.  The unit is move-in ready but offers a fantastic opportunity for updates and personal touches-reflected in the attractive price.  No rental restrictions.",
